joe Linux: what agetty needs to record logins, as glibc has it: updwtmp and updwtmpx, which append
a record to a login records file such as /var/log/wtmp (bionic's utmp functions are stubs: Android
keeps no records), utmpxname, _PATH_UTMP and _PATH_WTMP in <paths.h>, and vhangup. util-linux
builds agetty only where updwtmpx exists; without it the system had no getty.

